meta {
  name: scenarios
  seq: 11
}

script:pre-request {
  if (!bru.getVar("organizerToken")) {
    await bru.runRequest("auth/00-login.bru");
  }
}

docs {
  End-to-end regression scenarios. Can be run standalone with
  `bru run src/requests/scenarios --env local` (the folder-level
  pre-request script above logs in automatically as {{adminUsername}}
  and captures {{organizerToken}} if it is not already set), or as part
  of the full collection, after auth/.

  - manage-users/  - user lifecycle: admin creates EventOrganizers, owner self-edit,
                     role changes, disable/enable, password reset, negative-authorization
                     checks (403/404/422).
  - manage-event/  - event + guest lifecycle: create event, fill every payload
                     (locations, program, contacts, wedding top-level + 6 sub-payloads),
                     archive, then a fresh event with two guest groups, add/move/delete
                     guests, RSVP (group + single + reset), cleanup.
}